        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6e4be9ee7539458fb3b6607252390c48",
      "statement": "The sort setting flows from PlayerSettingsRepository through PlayerRuntime and PlayerViewModel StateFlows (stateIn with IMPORT_ORDER/true initial values) into AppNavHost, PlaylistRouteState and PlaylistScreen, and is finally applied in LocalMusicManagementView over songs filtered to uri != null, memoized on content hashes of the playCounts/lastPlayedAt maps so fresh Map instances do not force a re-sort; the library list arriving there is already grouped by groupKey, so equal-key versions stay adjacent only when the sort is stable.",
