    {
      "id": "claim_d6c6e30ff9f147cc93dbb079957bd8a8",
      "statement": "The data behind PLAY_COUNT and LAST_PLAYED sorting is loaded with the library snapshot into PlayerUiState.playCounts/lastPlayedAt from getPlayCountsForSort (the effective play_count column) and getLastPlayedAtForSort (only rows with a non-null timestamp), so the sort never queries Room at render time.",
