    {
      "id": "claim_64ae2cd0a091431280a4e081b33c6917",
      "statement": "Detach, reassign and reset all funnel through SongGroupCoordinator.updateGroupKey: it calls the injected updateSongTitleOverride(songId, override) first and returns SongGroupUpdate(updated = false) without reading the repository snapshot when that write fails; on success it re-reads the song list and only recomputes currentSong and sameNameSongs when the edited song is the currently playing one. isPlayable defaults to uri != null and is injectable for tests.",
