    {
      "id": "claim_5f78119ffba64ba2b3438ec142272fe6",
      "statement": "Group overrides persist in the song_group_overrides table (songId primary key, nullable titleOverride, updatedAt): every whole-library persist rewrites the table — replaceSongs deletes all rows and re-upserts only songs whose titleOverride is non-null, so clearing an override removes its row — and RoomMusicLibraryDataSource.restore reads the table once at startup and maps each row back onto its song.",
