      "statement": "DB migration v19→v20 executes a single DELETE FROM song_group_overrides because legacy overrides stored pure titles that cannot be mapped onto the new title+artist+album group key; the reset deliberately occupies its own version (so devices already at 19 still run it), MelodyDatabase is at version 20, users must re-associate manually afterwards, and the legacy pure-title case is pinned to neither crash nor merge into a default group.",
