    {
      "id": "claim_af77860522c14f0da5a028af95b34ab8",
      "statement": "Version groups are consumed as follows: SongVersionManager.groupedSongs keeps playable songs grouped by groupKey in encounter order, sortedSameNameSongs orders a group's playable members by sampleRate descending and feeds the playback panel's version switcher, the version-management screen shows only groups with at least two songs that have a uri (versions sorted by sampleRate descending), playing a version scopes the queue to all songs sharing its groupKey, and the group list itself (both screens, plus comparison prev/next) is ordered by plain String comparison of the group label rather than by the pinyin collator used for the local music list.",
