    {
      "id": "claim_a92a5ecf9f794c458ac5bef318bc9022",
      "statement": "The recommended version is the maximum qualityScore — sampleRate multiplied by 1.0 for extensions in LOSSLESS_EXTENSIONS and 0.6 otherwise, normalized by the group's maximum score — with the higher bitrate string (parsed as the number before the first space) as tiebreak, so a 44.1 kHz FLAC outranks a 48 kHz MP3; diffHint reuses the same comparison without bitrate/file-size injection and reports the first two differing labels, \"… 等 N 项不同\" beyond two, or \"规格一致\" when nothing differs.",
      "evidence": [
