      "id": "claim_378ecb76cf08477fa432c7f4451004d7",
      "statement": "File-derived comparison data crosses into the Android-free :domain layer by injection: VersionComparisonScreen loads each version's SongInfo through loadSongInfoSafely and passes bitRateOf/fileSizeOf lambdas into SongVersionComparer.compare, recomputing when the metadata map arrives. loadSongInfoSafely rethrows CancellationException and swallows other throwables, the build forbids bare loadSongInfo calls, and :core:model/:domain may not import android.* beyond a named baseline that currently includes core/model/.../Song.kt for android.net.Uri.",
