    {
      "id": "claim_b25f8953a74f4bbabbbbfca9b867c5ad",
      "statement": "Version management and version comparison are feature-owned routes in AppNavHost — \"version-management\" and \"version-comparison/{groupId}\" where groupId is the URL-encoded groupKey — entered from the 文件管理 card on the library screen and mapped by RouteAffinity to the 曲库 (PLAYLIST) top-level tab rather than to the 我的 (USER) children; comparison prev/next navigation computes sibling groups with at least two playable songs ordered by groupKeyLabel and navigates with popUpTo(VERSION_COMPARISON, inclusive) so the neighbour replaces the current comparison page.",
