      "statement": "Focused test coverage of the sorting/grouping area is uneven: SongSorterTest pins only BIT_RATE ordering in both directions plus unknown (0 kbps) staying low while ascending, leaving the collator and id-tiebreak comparators unasserted; SongGroupKeyTest pins the group-key shapes (including the non-merging legacy override), SongVersionComparerTest pins ordering, common/diff partitioning, conditional rows and the recommendation rules, SongGroupCoordinatorTest pins the detach/reassign/reset writes and the failed-write short-circuit, and MelodyDatabaseMigrationTest pins the v20 override wipe.",
